,"classification":["serif"],"contrast":["high"],"language":["ca","el","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"Aviano is an extended titling face with influence from the power and timeless beauty of classical letterforms. Aviano features extended characters for a formal feel, sharp, powerful looking serifs and geometric and consistent letterforms. Use Aviano as an alternative to Trajan. Be sure to check out the rest of the Aviano series, including Aviano Serif, Aviano Sans and Aviano Slab.","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n3","n4","n7","n9"],"lastModified":1484524901861},{"id":"lyqr","name":"Aviano Didone","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-didone","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["serif"],"contrast":["high"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"The Aviano series returns with a Didone or Modern face. Aviano Didone’s high contrast forms lend elegant beauty, luxury and romance to your designs and its extended letterforms provide strength and power. Aviano’s foundational classical forms give the face a look that is unique for Didone faces.","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n2","n3","n5","n7","n9"],"lastModified":1506729705898,"__v":0},{"id":"rtjn","name":"Aviano Flare","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-flare","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["sans-serif"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"Aviano Flare’s subtly curved forms lend refinement and luxurious elegance to your designs. Aviano’s foundational extended classical forms give the face strength and power. Aviano Flare is a versatile new addition to the Aviano titling series.","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n1","n3","n4","n5","n7","n9"],"lastModified":1484524901864},{"id":"dknz","name":"Aviano Future","web_link":"http://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/aviano-future","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"The Aviano series returns with a vigorous and futuristic sans serif. Aviano Future’s powerful squared forms lend intensity and authority to your designs. Aviano Future’s extended forms give the face strength and muscle. Aviano Future is a versatile new addition to the Aviano titling series.","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n1","n1","n3","n3","n4","n4","n7","n7","n8","n8","n9","n9"],"lastModified":1739577083347,"__v":0},{"id":"ckxm","name":"Aviano Royale","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-royale","browse_info":{"capitals":[],"classification":[],"contrast":[],"language":[],"number_style":[],"recommended_for":[],"weight":[],"width":[],"x_height":[]},"description":null,"foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n2","n3","n4","n7","n8","n9"],"lastModified":1557964926776,"__v":0},{"id":"vbkn","name":"Aviano Sans","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-sans","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["sans-serif"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"In 2007, insigne released Aviano. Aviano’s beautifully drawn extended letterforms were a hit with designers and quickly became insigne’s most popular offering of early 2007. Now, insigne returns to the classical forms that were the inspiration for Aviano with a sans serif variant. Aviano Sans is wide and geometric, and is perfect for any job that calls for a chic and dignified sans serif. Aviano Sans 2009 update includes two new weights, Thin and Black. Be sure to check out the rest of the Aviano series, including Aviano, Aviano Serif, Aviano Sans, and Aviano Slab.","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n1","n3","n4","n7","n9"],"lastModified":1506729705897,"__v":0},{"id":"qnpv","name":"Aviano Serif","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-serif","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["serif"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":["ca","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"Insigne’s popular Aviano series returns with Aviano Serif. Aviano Serif features the same classically inspired and extended proportions of Aviano, but instead of the brush drawn forms of the original, Aviano Serif features a more geometric take with small, sharp serifs. Aviano Serif is perfect for mastheads, headlines and powerful logotypes. The Aviano Serif family includes four weights for a wide array of design possibilities. ","foundry":"Insigne Design","variations":["n3","n4","n7","n9"],"lastModified":1506729705898,"__v":0},{"id":"bymb","name":"Aviano Slab","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/aviano-slab","browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["slab-serif"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":["ca","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","regular"],"width":["extended"],"x_height":[]},"description":"Aviano Slab is an extended slab serif and t