sualizations.\r\nIts use ranges from logotypes to titling in editorial and screen design.\r\n","foundry":"Buro Destruct","variations":["n5"],"lastModified":1506729705920,"__v":0},{"id":"xvch","name":"BD Colonius","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/bd-colonius","browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["de","en","es","it","nl","sv"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":[]},"description":"BD Colonius is based on circles and was created in 2001 initially for a logotype work.\r\nIts use ranges from logotypes to titling in editorial design.","foundry":"Buro Destruct","variations":["n4"],"lastModified":1506729705916,"__v":0},{"id":"clbv","name":"BD Geminis","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/bd-geminis","browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["high"],"language":["de","en","es","fr","it","nl","pt","sv"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":[]},"description":"BD Geminis is an alphabet inspired by the numbers of the MICR font. Good for geeks. Uppercase with alternatives. Created in 2003\r\n","foundry":"Buro Destruct","variations":["n4"],"lastModified":1506729705920,"__v":0},{"id":"fghq","name":"BD Jupiter","web_link":"http://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/bd-jupiter","browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["low"],"language":[],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"The BD Jupiter font family contains the four styles: regular, bold, regular stencil and bold stencil and was created in 2006.\r\nThe inspiration source for this font are stencil letterings on architectural plans, military boxes and machines etc.\r\nBD Jupiter’s main characteristics are the open shapes in A, R, P, a b, e, g, p, q and the serif spaces in I, J. L, S, T, f, g, i, j, l, r, t.\r\nThe stencil version adds even more characteristics to some of the letters.\r\nBD  Jupiter's use ranges from big lettering on products, buildings, maps, graphic-charts, interface-design to titles in print and web with a cool approach.","foundry":"Buro Destruct","variations":["n4","n7"],"lastModified":1743119510526,"__v":0},{"id":"gzsg","name":"BD Jupiter Stencil","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/bd-jupiter-stencil","browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","de","en","es","fr","it","nl","pt","sv"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"The BD Jupiter font family contains the four styles: regular, bold, regular stencil and bold stencil and was created in 2006. The inspiration source for this font are stencil letterings on architectural plans, military boxes and machines etc. BD Jupiter’s main characteristics are the open shapes in A, R, P, a b, e, g, p, q and the serif spaces in I, J. L, S, T, f, g, i, j, l, r, t. The stencil version adds even more characteristics to some of the letters. BD Jupiter's use ranges from big lettering on products, buildings, maps, graphic-charts, interface-design to titles in print and web with a cool approach.","foundry":"Buro Destruct","variations":["n4","n7"],"lastModified":1506729705917,"__v":0},{"id":"hkvz","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":[],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":["headings"],"weight":["heavy"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":[]},"description":null,"foundry":"Buro Destruct","lastModified":1597540258244,"name":"BD Kickrom Mono","variations":["n4"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/bd-kickrom-mono"},{"id":"xpbt","name":"BD Nippori","web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/bd-nippori","browse_info":{"