ke ten feet tall each. I've made these much smaller for you. It's not a real unique font, but it does have a nice grainy texture to it. You'll appreciate it's throaty roar when you need to send a message in a familiar-yet-toothy loud font. Harvester comes to you in ALL CAPS format, but at least you get two kinds of caps. The caps are regular, then repeated in the lowercase slots as a stencil varietal. So it's gonna be a loud font, no matter what you do with it. Be careful. Stuff some cotton in your ears before you use this one.","foundry":"Chank Co","lastModified":1588840822280,"name":"Harvester","variations":["n9"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/harvester"},{"id":"yqxb","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["slab-serif"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":[],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":["headings"],"weight":["heavy","regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["regular"]},"description":null,"foundry":"ps Type","lastModified":1588840822291,"name":"Hatch","variations":["n3","i3","n4","i4","n5","i5","n7","i7"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/hatch"},{"id":"dkys","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":[],"classification":[],"contrast":[],"language":[],"number_style":[],"recommended_for":[],"weight":[],"width":[],"x_height":[]},"description":null,"foundry":"ps Type","lastModified":1710551486405,"name":"Hatch Sans","variations":["n1","i1","n3","i3","n4","i4","n5","i5","n6","i6","n7","i7"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/hatch-sans"},{"id":"lcgj","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":[],"classification":[],"contrast":[],"language":[],"number_style":[],"recommended_for":[],"weight":[],"width":[],"x_height":[]},"description":null,"foundry":"Red Rooster Collection","is_personal":false,"lastModified":1759189885705,"name":"Hauser Script","variations":["n4"],"web_link":"http://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/hauser-script"},{"id":"hkvl","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["decorative"],"con