number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["regular"]},"description":"Peacock is a collaboration between Brian Jaramillo and Tim Ahrens. It was formerly titled Caramel. Jaramillo completed most of the glyphs in 2007, and contacted Ahrens to help with the OpenType and help refine the typeface, and set-up the OpenType features.","foundry":"Just Another Foundry","lastModified":1588840823240,"name":"JAF Peacock Swash","variations":["n4"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/jaf-peacock-swash"},{"id":"rvhs","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","nl","pl","pt","ru","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["condensed"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"Blackletter, sans serif, graffiti, constructivism: all these influences are combined into a lively and dynamic – and somehow “disobedient” – typeface. Since blackletter fonts typically don’t look great when used in all-caps, Zalamander comes with a special Caps version that contains letter variants that combine nicely in uppercase. All fonts support Cyrillic.","foundry":"Just Another Foundry","lastModified":1588840823235,"name":"JAF Zalamander","variations":["n2","n3","n4","n6","n7","n8"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/jaf-zalamander"},{"id":"lpgt","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","de","en","es","fr","it","nl","pt","sv"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["condensed"],"x_height":[]},"description":"Blackletter, sans serif, graffiti, constructivism: all these influences are combined into a lively and dynamic – and somehow “disobedient” – typeface. Since blackletter fonts typically don’t look great when used in all-caps, Zalamander comes with a special Caps version that contains letter variants that combine nicely in uppercase. All fonts support Cyrillic.","foundry":"Just Another Foundry","lastModified":1588840823244,"name":"JAF Zalamander Caps","variations":["n2","n3","n4","n6","n7","n8"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/jaf-zalamander-caps"},{"id":"fdcy","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["handmade"],"contrast":["regular"],"language":[],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["regular"]},"description":null,"foundry":"Paratype","lastModified":1588840823252,"name":"Jakob","variations":["n3","n4","n7"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/jakob"},{"id":"xwyz","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["all-or-small-caps"],"classification":["decorative"],"contrast":["high"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"Jana Thork is a synthesis of the stone engraved capital letterforms and the uncial and half-uncial calligraphic styles. The idea of the typeface designer, Ricardo Esteves Gomes, was to seek for the limits between our uppercase and lowercase mental concepts. Jana Thork family comes with more than 120 extras including ligatures and swashes. If you want to use open type features you can see them all (ligatures, swashes and fractions) in one font file, that is Jana Thork Pro. The family also includes Jana Thork Bold versions and Jana Thork Pro Bold - a complement to this font family that can be used in graphic designs that need more complex hierarchic relations or greater visual impact. This family can be useful to compose titles, short texts and letterings that need to look attractive to the eye. ","foundry":"Outras Fontes","lastModified":1588840823231,"name":"JanaThork-Pro","variations":["n4","n