xyb","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["sans-serif"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","cs","da","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","no","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["regular"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"Frustrated with a lack of fonts both versatile and modern, we set out to design Klavika as a full-featured, do-it-all sans serif for the needs of the 21st century. Our result is a design that’s unadorned, modern and infinitely flexible. To achieve this, Klavika follows a decidedly hybrid typographic path – a cross of humanist and geometric influences with allegiances to neither. Crisp and open shapes keep the font legible in small sizes while the straight-sided characters anchor headlines and display work solidly in place.","foundry":"Process Type Foundry","lastModified":1645751470443,"name":"Klavika Basic","variations":["n3","i3","n4","i4","n6","i6","n7","i7"],"web_link":"http://typekit.com/fonts/klavika-web"},{"id":"srft","__v":0,"browse_info":{"capitals":["uppercase-lowercase"],"classification":["sans-serif"],"contrast":["low"],"language":["ca","cs","de","en","es","fr","hu","it","mt","nl","pl","pt","sl","sv","tr"],"number_style":["uppercase"],"recommended_for":[],"weight":["heavy","light","regular"],"width":["condensed"],"x_height":["high"]},"description":"Like its big brother, Klavika Condensed is a typographic hybrid – the font combines the best influences from humanist and geometric sources while holding allegiances for neither. The result is a font with a crisp page color that’s warm and modern in outlook. Like Klavika, the fonts are versatile do-it-all sans serifs well-suited for text and display work, especially in circumstances with limited space.","foundry":"Process Type Foundry","lastModified":1645751470429,"name":"Klavika Condensed","variations":["n3","i3","n4","i4","n5","i5","n7","i7"],"web_link":"http:/